# ================= 灵犀 · GitHub 仓库忽略清单 =================
# 原则：仓库里只放代码。数据、模型、运行环境、密钥、日志，一律不提交。

# ---------- 1. 你的数据（绝对不提交）----------
data/
backups/
face-lab/
output/
dist/
release/*.zip
损坏文件清单.*

# ---------- 2. 运行环境 / 模型 / 缓存 ----------
venv/
models/
.cache/
.browser/
**/node_modules/
run/.npm-cache/
run/domtest/
build/
.venv/

# ---------- 3. 日志和临时文件 ----------
logs/
*.log
debug.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.bak-*

# ---------- 4. 配置与密钥（最容易出事的一类）----------
config.ini
config.ini.bak*
.env
run/deploy/keys/
run/.pii_map.json
run/deploy/askpass.cmd
*.pem
*.key
**/known_hosts
run/deploy/_local_db_backup*.db
run/deploy/_*.tgz
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ---------- 5. run/ 只提交运行必需的那一小撮 ----------
# 其余三百多个是开发期脚本（探测 / 压测 / 截图），带内网地址，不适合放公开仓库
/run/*
!/run/restart_server.py
!/run/snapshot.py
!/run/ui_window.py
!/run/git_update.bat
!/run/git_publish.py
!/run/ocr_bridges/
/run/deploy/*
!/run/deploy/*.py
!/run/deploy/*.sh
!/run/deploy/*.md
!/run/deploy/lingxi.service

# ---------- 6. Python 缓存 ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
